  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nReplica Newspaper: Victory in Europe\n£3.95\n\nReplica Newspaper: Victory in Europe quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nThis pack contains a complete replica of the Daily Sketch from May 8th 1945, when George VI declared a two-day public holiday to celebrate Victory in Europe. Photographs of famous London landmarks, plus world-wide news, adverts, cartoons and radio programmes of the day. This is a brilliant educational aid for children and adults alike.\n\nRelated products\nHome Guard Replica Pack\n£5.95 Read more\nA Cool and Lonely Courage: The Women of the SOE\n£15.00 Add to cart\nReplica Newspaper: D-Day\n£3.95 Add to cart\nPrint: Action at Nonne Bosschen (Nun’s Wood), 25 November 1914\n£27.50 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
